sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Store as SessionStore
    participant Orch as TurnPlaybackOrchestrator
    participant TL as PlaybackTimelineRuntime
    participant Sinks as Text/Audio Sinks
    participant Audio as HTMLAudioElement
    participant Clock as Timeline AudioClock
    participant Engine as ModelEngine
    participant Lip as LipSync Sink
    participant SDK as Live2D WebSDK
    participant Projection as SessionProjection
    participant Completion as CompletionCoordinator

    Store-->>Orch: 原子 segment ready(turn_id, message_id)
    Orch->>TL: 查询 open required execution timelines
    alt 仍有开放 required sink
        TL-->>Orch: blocked，等待 execution state change
    else 没有开放 required sink
        TL-->>Orch: releasable
        Orch->>TL: startSegmentJob(text, audio, motion)
    end

    alt audio.state = present
        TL->>TL: 创建 segment timeline，注册 audio required sink
        opt motion payload 已声明
            TL->>TL: 注册 motion required sink<br/>requiredForStart=false
        end
        TL->>Sinks: release segment audio URL
        Sinks->>Audio: 创建 AudioElement，load/play

        Audio-->>TL: loadedmetadata(duration)
        TL->>Clock: set expected duration
        TL->>Projection: markAudioDuration
        Projection->>Store: audio.duration

        alt motion.state = present
            TL->>Engine: prepare semantic motion with duration snapshot
            Engine->>Engine: 编译 axis graph / gesture / timing / curve
            Engine-->>TL: prepared plan / explicit failure
        else motion.state = absent 且 voice-following 可用
            TL->>Engine: prepare internal speech_only request
            Engine->>Engine: 在编译边界适配为 parameter plan
            Engine-->>TL: prepared / not_applicable / failure
            opt prepared
                TL->>TL: 升级并注册 required motion sink<br/>requiredForStart=false
            end
        end

        Note over Audio,TL: loadedmetadata 只用于准备；<br/>不能作为“声音已开始”的事实。

        Audio-->>TL: playing(startedAt, duration, segment-bound clock)
        TL->>Clock: attach event 携带的 AudioElement clock
        Clock-->>TL: currentTime/duration/playbackRate/playing
        TL->>Projection: markAudioStarted(startedAt,duration)
        Projection->>Store: audio.started
        TL->>TL: 音频 sink 已 started，Timeline 进入 playing<br/>motion sink 仍可保持 pending

        par 同一个 playing 事实释放字幕
            TL->>Sinks: release segment canonical subtitle
            Sinks-->>Store: text.delivered
        and 启动口型
            TL->>Lip: attach/start same AudioElement
            Lip->>Lip: WebAudio analyser RMS
            Lip->>SDK: source-scoped active state + mouth value
            Lip-->>TL: lip_sync.started
        and 唤醒已准备动作
            TL->>Engine: handlePlaybackTimelineStarted(latest clock)
            Engine->>SDK: start prepared parameter plan
            SDK-->>TL: motion.started(runId)
            opt 正式 motion.state = present
                TL->>Projection: markMotionStarted
                Projection->>Store: motion.started
            end
            opt internal speech_only
                Note over TL,Store: Timeline 记录表现层 sink<br/>不改写稳定的 motion absent
            end
        end

        Note over Audio,Clock: Clock 永久绑定该 segment 创建的 AudioElement；<br/>禁止查询全局 active audio element。
        Note over Engine,SDK: 不添加固定 90ms/260ms 延迟。<br/>视觉入场延迟只来自 parameter plan / performance curve。

        loop 每个渲染帧
            Clock-->>Engine: 可用的 segment-scoped 时间上下文
            SDK->>SDK: Mixer 采样 plan / speech gesture raw target 并合成最终目标
            SDK->>SDK: ParameterPresentation 对非口型目标执行一次 dynamics
            Lip->>SDK: 同一音频 source 的 active state + RMS mouth value
            SDK->>SDK: ActiveParameterMixer 以即时路径写入口型；direct-only response state 不被污染
        end

        alt Audio ended
            Audio-->>TL: completed
            Lip-->>TL: completed 或已记录的 failed
            SDK-->>TL: motion completed / failed
        else Audio error
            Audio-->>TL: failed(reason)
            TL->>SDK: interrupt still-open required motion
            TL->>Lip: stop lip-sync
        else 用户或后端显式中断
            TL->>Audio: stop exact segment
            TL->>SDK: interrupt exact turn+message run
            TL->>Lip: interrupt exact segment
        end

        TL->>Projection: project stable audio / declared motion terminal
        Projection->>Store: segment execution facts

    else audio.state = absent 且 motion.state = present
        opt text.state = present
            TL->>Sinks: 立即释放 text
            Sinks-->>Store: text.delivered
        end
        TL->>Clock: 创建 explicit synthetic motion-only clock
        TL->>Engine: compile/start motion-only plan
        Engine->>SDK: parameter plan
        SDK-->>TL: motion started/terminal
        TL->>Projection: project motion facts

    else audio.state = absent 且 motion 非 present
        opt text.state = present
            TL->>Sinks: 立即释放 text
            Sinks-->>Store: text.delivered
        end
        Note over TL,Store: 无媒体时钟，不伪造 synthetic audio。

    else audio.state = failed
        TL->>Projection: audio failed
        opt motion.state = present
            TL->>Projection: motion failed<br/>不改走 motion-only
        end
        opt text 是等待音频的字幕
            TL->>Sinks: reject waiting subtitle
            Sinks->>Store: text failed<br/>不转成独立气泡
        end
    end

    Store-->>Completion: protocol slots settled + synthFinished
    Completion->>TL: 查询同 turn_id 的 open required execution
    alt speech-only 或其它 required sink 仍开放
        TL-->>Completion: 暂不发送 playback_finished
    else 同 Turn execution 已收口
        TL-->>Completion: no open required execution
        Completion-->>Store: phase = settling
        Completion->>Completion: 计算 text/audio/motion failure -> success
    end
